   1	4047							; --- PT3 REPLAYER WORKING ON ROM ---
   2	4047							; --- Can be assembled with asMSX ---
   3	4047							; --- ROM version: MSX-KUN        ---
   4	4047							; --- asMSX version 2: SapphiRe   ---
   5	4047					
   6	4047					; Based on MSX full version of PT3 by Dioniso
   7	4047					;
   8	4047					; This version of the replayer can be used with any note table
   9	4047					; This version also allows the use of PT3 commands
  10	4047					; First 99 bytes of each PT3 module should be stripped off
  11	4047					;
  12	4047					; PLAY and PSG WRITE routines seperated to allow independent calls
  13	4047					;
  14	4047					; ROM LENGTH: 1549 bytes
  15	4047					; RAM LENGTH:  576 bytes
  16	4047					
